**Action:** required: re-verify any code, test, or tooling that references the runtime error identifier `INVALID_CONTROL_HOST` or matches the message text `is an invalid control host`; update it to `INVALID_FIELD_DIRECTIVE_HOST` / `is an invalid [field] directive host`. The numeric code `318` is unchanged, so code keyed on the number needs no change. No changes needed to `Field`, `ɵControl`, or component/template code that binds `[field]` to a valid host.

